<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28668" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠσανά-ληπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to recover</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνήμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcid.
					<u>Soph.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hard to recover from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρωστία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					6.181a
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήπτως,
			ἔχειν</span> to be <i>in a bad way for recovery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.47.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of an
			athlete, <i>unable to return to ordinary habits</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				1.6
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
